# Local state, URL params & drafts (target state)

## URL as navigation SSOT

- Event/director tabs should stay synced with `?tab=` (and related query params). Prefer updating search params over inventing a second tab store.
- Do not break `?view=bowler` or role-prefix redirects when adding links or default tabs.

## Client drafts

- Form draft helpers (`*DraftStorage.ts`) are UX convenience only — never treat localStorage as source of truth for scores, bracket runs, fees, or access.
- Key draft caches by stable IDs (`user_id`, `eventId`, `tournamentId`), not display names.
- Clear or version draft keys when schema shape changes so stale drafts cannot corrupt new forms.

## Modals & ephemeral UI

- Prefer `useModalState` / small hooks over sprawling boolean `useState` lists on pages.
- Do not persist modal open state to the URL unless product explicitly requires shareable deep links.
